                "area": null,
                "cost": {
                    "value": ""
                },
                "counteraction": true,
                "damage": {},
                "defense": null,
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>You send a surge of healing energy to restore the target's body. Attempt to counteract an effect of your choice imposing one of these conditions on the target: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]. If you didn't counteract the effect, but you would have if its counteract rank were 2 lower, instead suppress the effect until the beginning of your next turn. The effect's duration doesn't elapse while it's suppressed.</p>\n<p>This spell can't counteract or suppress curses, diseases, or conditions that are part of the target's normal state.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> Add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Drained] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed] to the list of conditions.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> As 4th rank, plus add @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Petrified].</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> As 4th rank, plus add petrified and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned].</p>"
                },
