                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The bannik is in their bound bath</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The bannik conjures a plume of superheated steam in a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 20 feet. Each creature in the area takes @Damage[6d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:22|basic] save). The bannik can't use Boil Alive again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Boil Alive]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
                },
