                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A bannik's bathhouse never encounters random accidents, and any mortal that bathes there receives a +2 status bonus to Fortitude saves against disease for 1 week. An unfriendly bannik can invert their blessing—bathers take a –2 status penalty instead. A bannik must spend a week in a place before these benefits occur.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
